Package: MAniR
Type: Project
Title: Interactive Pairwise Matrix Comparison for MALDI-TOF and Genomic Analysis
Version: 3.0.0
Authors@R: person("BiKC", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "opensource@example.invalid")
Description: Shiny application to compare similarity, correlation and distance
